% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


norm gdpr 6 1 is identified by "http://example.org/cases/gdpr6#Norm_GDPR_6_1".

norm gdpr 6 1 is a substantive rule.

norm gdpr 6 1 has the label "GDPR Article 6(1): lawfulness of processing".

norm gdpr 6 1 has the modality permission.

norm gdpr 6 1 is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2016/679/art_6/par_1/oj".

norm gdpr 6 1 has the legal text "Processing shall be lawful only if and to the extent that at least one of the following applies: (a) the data subject has given consent to the processing of his or her personal data for one or more specific purposes; (b) processing is necessary for the performance of a contract to which the data subject is party or in order to take steps at the request of the data subject prior to entering into a contract; (c) processing is necessary for compliance with a legal obligation to which the controller is subject; (d) processing is necessary in order to protect the vital interests of the data subject or of another natural person; (e) processing is necessary for the performance of a task carried out in the public interest or in the exercise of official authority vested in the controller; (f) processing is necessary for the purposes of the legitimate interests pursued by the controller or by a third party, except where such interests are overridden by the interests or fundamental rights and freedoms of the data subject which require protection of personal data, in particular where the data subject is a child.".

norm gdpr 6 1 produces process personal data.


process personal data is identified by "http://example.org/cases/gdpr6#ProcessPersonalData".

process personal data is an action.

process personal data has the label "process personal data".

process personal data has the agent role role controller.

process personal data has the agent role role data subject.


role controller is identified by "http://example.org/cases/gdpr6#Role_Controller".

role controller is an agent role.

role controller is for the agent controllers.

role controller has the role addresser.


role data subject is identified by "http://example.org/cases/gdpr6#Role_DataSubject".

role data subject is an agent role.

role data subject is for the agent data subjects.

role data subject has the role beneficiary.


controllers is identified by "http://example.org/cases/gdpr6#Controllers".

controllers is an agent type.

controllers has the label "Controllers".


data subjects is identified by "http://example.org/cases/gdpr6#DataSubjects".

data subjects is an agent type.

data subjects has the label "Data subjects".


